  "prompt": "Use case: ui-mockup. Create ONE polished visual comparison board for small category-chip icons in the Korean creator platform crefans. This is a style exploration, not final production assets.\n\nClean white canvas, high-resolution landscape board, three equally sized horizontal sections stacked vertically, generous whitespace and precise alignment. At the top show only \"카테고리 아이콘 스타일 비교\". Use crisp, legible Korean sans-serif type.\n\nEvery section must show the SAME four concepts, in the SAME order: 코스프레 (a pink costume ribbon with one simple sparkle), 음악 (a violet musical note), 여행 (a blue small suitcase), 게임 (a blue-violet game controller). Four equal columns per section. In every cell show a larger 64px-ish icon above and a compact realistic rounded UI chip beneath, with a small 20px-ish version of the exact same icon to the LEFT of its Korean label. Chips should be about 40px high in the represented interface, pale gray (#F5F5F8) background, charcoal label 14px-ish; icon/text gap6px. In each row the first chip only is selected with pale blue background (#EFF6FF) and blue text (#2563EB). Keep the chip backgrounds, dimensions, font, selected-state treatment and subject silhouettes identical across sections so only icon rendering style differs.\n\nSection headings, exactly:\n\"01  라운드 플랫\"\n\"02  컬러 라인\"\n\"03  소프트 3D\"\n\n01 ROUND FLAT: extremely simple friendly rounded solid shapes; two restrained colors per icon; no outlines, no gradients, no shadows, bold readable silhouettes. Matte pink/violet/blue palette consistent with crefans. Finished compact product UI quality. \n02 COLOR LINE: visibly different from row01; rounded uniform medium-weight outlines, mostly hollow interiors, only one small solid color accent. Same motifs and color assignments. Not wispy, enough thickness to read at20px. Flat, no shadow.\n03 SOFT3D: visibly different rounded clay-like mini objects with subtle shallow volume, gentle ambient shading, matte materials and modest highlights. Same motifs and color assignments. Limited detail, avoid glossy glass or metallic finish, avoid giant dramatic shadows.\n\nAvoid added frames around individual icons, emojis, cartoon faces, watermarks, photography, unrelated symbols, fake app chrome, extra explanatory prose. Show all12 large icons and all12 miniature chip examples completely, with no cropping. This board should make choosing one cohesive icon family easy.\n",
